# Registered held-out mutation seed: counterevidence attacks an inference.

claim store-room-is-damp
  The textile store room has excessive humidity.

observation ceiling-sensor-high
  The ceiling sensor reports eighty percent relative humidity.

observation reference-meter-normal
  A recently calibrated reference meter reports forty-eight percent.

observation ceiling-sensor-damaged
  The ceiling sensor casing shows visible water damage.

link humidity-inference: ceiling-sensor-high supports store-room-is-damp
  weight 0.82 measured

link ceiling-sensor-damaged undercuts humidity-inference
  weight 0.88 measured

link reference-meter-normal opposes store-room-is-damp
  weight 0.8 measured

conservator holds store-room-is-damp
  confidence 0.2 estimated

